Z||000001||theogre||05-24-2001||03:40 PM||||The strongest one I've seen GM list is a DIS motor in a 90-91 olds. I forget just which. ?That one was listed at 110.<P>Depending on just how they configured it, it will only "drop in" to an 87 or later Fiero. Even then you may have to change stuff on the motor beyond pulleys and things. Some configurations of the DIS motor have electric EGR.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 05-24-2001).]||||reg||1
